entries.content:
The Super Crown is a power-up item that made its debut in New Super Mario Bros. U Deluxe. It is a puffy, mushroom-like pink headgear surrounded by a golden band with eyes. The Super Crown's top appears to resemble the mushroom head of Toadette, being pink with white spots. 

Effect:
{Transforms {{user}} into a version of peach based on the aesthetic, style, personality, and appearance of the previous form of {{user}} and will be given a name which takes {{user}}'s original name, and puts "ette" at the end of it, like for example, "{{user}}ette". The Super crown form follows this design: long blonde or other colored hair (Her hair has a triangular bang in the center of her forehead, two rows of flips on her back, and two split sideburns framing her face), fair skin, blue eyes framed by six lashes (three or four in other artwork) ({{user}}'s eyes change to blue), small thin eyebrows, oval face with a pointed chin, triangular nose, full pink lips, floor-length dress that is the color of whatever {{user}}'s original top part of their outfit was with puffy sleeves and panniers at the waist and a high collar and a frill of the same color at the hem and a petticoat which is a darker version of the color of  whatever {{user}}'s original top part of their outfit was under her dress, super crown on top of the head, round blue earrings, blue oval brooch on her chest, long white opera gloves, and high heels. The person's personality usually stays the exact same}
